":"Baal jhopla aahe.","en":"The baby is asleep."}},{"id":203,"category":"family","en":"Boy","hi":"लड़का","mr":"मुलगा","mr_roman":"mulga","example":{"mr":"तो मुलगा धावतोय.","roman":"To mulga dhavtoy.","en":"That boy is running."}},{"id":204,"category":"family","en":"Girl","hi":"लड़की","mr":"मुलगी","mr_roman":"mulgi","example":{"mr":"ती मुलगी गाते.","roman":"Ti mulgi gaate.","en":"That girl sings."}},{"id":205,"category":"family","en":"Old man","hi":"बूढ़ा","mr":"म्हातारा","mr_roman":"mhatara","example":{"mr":"म्हातारा माणूस हळू चालतो.","roman":"Mhatara manus halu chalto.","en":"The old man walks slowly."}},{"id":206,"category":"family","en":"Son-in-law","hi":"दामाद","mr":"जावई","mr_roman":"javai","example":{"mr":"जावई आले आहेत.","roman":"Javai aale aahet.","en":"Son-in-law has come."}},{"id":207,"category":"family","en":"Daughter-in-law","hi":"बहू","mr":"सून","mr_roman":"sun","example":{"mr":"सून स्वयंपाक करते.","roman":"Sun swayampak karte.","en":"Daughter-in-law is cooking."}},{"id":208,"category":"family","en":"Mother-in-law","hi":"सास","mr":"सासू","mr_roman":"sasu","example":{"mr":"सासूबाई देवळात गेल्या.","roman":"Sasubai devlat gelya.","en":"Mother-in-law went to the temple."}},{"id":209,"category":"family","en":"Father-in-law","hi":"ससुर","mr":"सासरे","mr_roman":"sasre","example":{"mr":"सासरे शेतावर गेले.","roman":"Sasre shetavar gele.","en":"Father-in-law went to the farm."}},{"id":210,"category":"family","en":"Person","hi":"व्यक्ति","mr":"व्यक्ती","mr_roman":"vyakti","example":{"mr":"ती व्यक्ती कोण?","roman":"Ti vyakti kon?","en":"Who is that person?"}}]